Usage

Load cosmic datasets into the ingestion pipeline.

Configure proton‑laser parameters via the GUI or YAML configuration files.

Select solver modules (PIC, Vlasov–Maxwell, MHD).

Submit jobs to SLURM/PBS.

Visualize results using the built‑in 3D analysis tools.

